WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.930
- Lamb chop. Lamb chop.

00:00:01.930 --> 00:00:04.410
Lamb chop, listen, darling.

00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:06.010
I'm in a total kerfuffle.

00:00:06.010 --> 00:00:07.570
The delivery for the muffins comes

00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:10.470
at 6:00 a.m. honey, not 6:00 p.m.

00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:11.870
You're driving me crazy,

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:14.580
and I can't fire you 'cause
I don't have the heart.

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:17.140
One of my first crushes was Darth Vader.

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:19.510
I used to have this
reoccuring dream about him

00:00:19.510 --> 00:00:20.343
when I was a kid.

00:00:20.343 --> 00:00:22.492
It had definite sexual
undertones. (laughing)

00:00:22.492 --> 00:00:23.325
(Ross laughing)
(audience laughing)

00:00:23.325 --> 00:00:25.351
- (panting) Just bring it on.

00:00:25.351 --> 00:00:26.880
- Yeah.
- Ooh!

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:28.861
(Drew wheezing)

00:00:28.861 --> 00:00:30.508
(Drew whooshing)

00:00:30.508 --> 00:00:34.176
Yes! Yes!

00:00:34.176 --> 00:00:35.009
Maybe.

00:00:35.009 --> 00:00:36.141
- Ooh.
- Ah.

00:00:36.141 --> 00:00:37.962
(Drew laughing)

00:00:37.962 --> 00:00:40.007
- Oh, my heart.
(Drew laughing)

00:00:40.007 --> 00:00:41.070
Are you ready, Drew?

00:00:41.070 --> 00:00:41.903
- Oh, okay.

00:00:41.903 --> 00:00:42.736
- Easy, right? Here.

00:00:42.736 --> 00:00:43.795
First time playing.

00:00:43.795 --> 00:00:44.628
- Oh, shoot.

00:00:44.628 --> 00:00:45.461
- [Ross] No, you're supposed to-

00:00:45.461 --> 00:00:47.403
- I suck at this game.

00:00:47.403 --> 00:00:48.750
(audience laughing)

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:50.583
- [Ross] Down, down, down!

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:55.583
(audience cheering)
(audience clapping)

00:00:57.311 --> 00:00:59.033
It worked, it worked, it worked!

